.SH NAME
.PP
mediafind - a program to find audio and video files f a s t.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.PP
\f[B]mediafind\f[R] [\f[I]OPTIONS\f[R]] \f[I]search_term\f[R]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
\f[B]mediafind\f[R] is a command-line tool to make, update, and search
local locate database files, 
.P
specifically for audio and media stores.
(It could be used for any types of files.)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\f[B]-h, help\f[R]
Show help message
.TP
\f[B]-d, dirs_only\f[R]
Output dirs only with matching files
.TP
\f[B]-m, metadata\f[R]
Show metadata (json format)
.TP
\f[B]-u, update\f[R]
Update databases**
.TP
\f[B]-a, audio_only\f[R]
Search audio databases only
.TP
\f[B]-v, video_only\f[R]
Search video databases only
